{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29553","headline":"韩冬郎即席爲诗相送一座尽惊他日余方追吟连宵侍坐裴回久之句有老成之风因成二绝寄酬兼呈畏之员外 二 · 李商隐","name":"韩冬郎即席爲诗相送一座尽惊他日余方追吟连宵侍坐裴回久之句有老成之风因成二绝寄酬兼呈畏之员外 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒栈风樯各苦辛，别时冰雪到时春。\n爲凭何逊休联句，瘦尽东阳姓沈人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}